Package: netquota
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), nftables, vnstat, iproute2, util-linux, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: firewalld
Description: Internet quota enforcement using nftables
 NetQuota enforces a combined download+upload Internet quota on one
 network interface using nftables (IPv4 and IPv6), with vnStat for display
 statistics. Ships a systemd service; the daemon runs as a dedicated
 unprivileged user with only CAP_NET_ADMIN.
